    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      554.32,
      550.73,
      645.79
    ],
    "text": "The \u2018Deep Depression\u2019 over the Bay of Bengal, located to the northeast of Sri Lanka, was centered approximately 645 km from Trincomalee as of 08.30 a.m. today (16 November). It is very likely to continue to move away from Sri Lanka and intensify into a \u2018Cyclonic Storm\u2019 by the evening of today over the southern and adjoining west-central Bay of Bengal, and further intensify into a \u2018Severe Cyclonic Storm\u2019 over the west-central Bay of Bengal by November 17.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
