      12.0,
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      93.02,
      177.98,
      516.05,
      189.98
    ],
    "text": "WEATHER FORECAST FOR SEA AREAS AROUND THE ISLAND DURING NEXT 24 HOURS",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      199.73,
      194.78,
      409.34,
      206.78
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 2.00 p.m. on 16 November 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      217.82,
      545.57,
      321.17
    ],
    "text": "The \u2018Deep Depression\u2019 over the Bay of Bengal, located to the northeast of Sri Lanka, was centered approximately 645 km from Trincomalee as of 08.30 a.m. today (16 November) near Latitude 11.2\u00b0N and Longitude 86.4\u00b0E. It is very likely to continue to move away from Sri Lanka and intensify into a \u2018Cyclonic Storm\u2019 by the evening of today over the southern and adjoining west-central Bay of Bengal, and further intensify into a \u2018Severe Cyclonic Storm\u2019 over the west-central Bay of Bengal by November 17.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      324.44,
      545.55,
      394.25
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 05N-17N and 80E-95E, and the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Pottuvil via Trincomalee and Batticaloa. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      397.55,
      545.0,
      434.93
    ],
    "text": "The naval and fishing communities, are requested to be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      437.84,
      151.29,
      456.17
    ],
    "text": "Condition of Rain:",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      468.29,
      505.85,
      480.29
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur at several places in the sea areas around the island.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      487.75,
      96.46,
      499.75
    ],
    "text": "Winds:",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      509.47,
      543.05,
      538.39
    ],
    "text": "Winds will be North-westerly or Westerly in the sea areas around the island. Wind speed will be (30-40) kmph.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      541.54,
      545.57,
      611.59
    ],
    "text": "Wind speed can increase up to 60 kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Pottuvil via Trincomalee and Batticaloa. Wind speed may increase up to 50 kmph at times in the other sea areas around the island. State of Sea:",
